WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.900
That takes care of the unexpected.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.620
For the jobs that come around regularly, routines

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.820
help your family keep track of who’s responsible.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.760
Add taking out the trash as a Tuesday

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.240
routine, then choose who will handle it.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.060
Assign it to a particular family member, or

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.760
leave it open for anyone to take care

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:19.060
of.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:22.340
The assignment appears with the task, and when

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.100
it’s marked done, everyone sees that it’s finished.
